Vendored: LuaBridge 2.10
Upstream: https://github.com/vinniefalco/LuaBridge/releases/tag/2.10
Licence:  MIT (see LICENSE)

Files taken: Source/LuaBridge/*.h and Source/LuaBridge/detail/*.h, flat, with
the detail/ subdirectory preserved.

Why LuaBridge over sol2: see specs/SPEC-lua-api-v0.md section 2 -- sol2's
template weight would slow down LMMS' already heavy Qt builds for no
capability the v0 API needs. 2.10 is the last tagged release of the original
LuaBridge and supports Lua 5.4 (upstream ships a Tests54 target against
Lua 5.4.4).

Local modifications: none.
